test result: ok. 4 passed; 0 failed
```

## Запуск

```bash
cd async_service
cargo run
```

Сервер запустится на `localhost:8083`. Пример запроса:

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8083/api/roof_angle_calculation/1/finish \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "snow_load": 200,
    "wind_load": 100,
    "materials": [
      {"id": 1, "min_angle": 15, "max_angle": 90},
      {"id": 2, "min_angle": 30, "max_angle": 60}
    ]
  }'
```
